seg-14ad6b7911d6 = Input is the live JSON-lines schema v1.1 documented in <c1/>. Read: <c2/>; <c3/> (<c4/>, the band); <c5/> (0-100 or null); <c6/> (the epoch's time as stated); <c7/> (<c8/>); <c9/> (<c10/>, <c11/>, <c12/>, or null); reasons are the monitors in <c13/>, then any further ones in <c14/>; from schema { "1.3" }, <c15/> (<c16/>, <c17/>, <c18/>, <c19/>) and each deduction's <c20/>. Other keys are ignored, since the schema only grows by appended keys. A line that does not parse is counted in <c21/> and skipped; scores outside 0-100 are rejected, not clamped, so a format change is noticed. The only code that knows this format is <c22/>.

