seg-3f45b21003d5 = The <c1/> label is part of a series' identity: when a reason's class changes between epochs (<c2/> from <c3/> to <c4/> when the satellites lost were low, or <c5/> to <c6/> when the stated HDOP disagrees with the stated sky), the old series is no longer exported and a new one starts. Query by <c7/> with <c8/> when the class does not matter, and expect such a flip to look like one series ending and another beginning. The schema { "1.3" } series, the <c9/> label and the CEF/LEEF geometry fields are checked by the engine's own tests and by the CEF oracles (pycef, Logstash); the external Prometheus and OTLP oracles have no { "1.3" } stream yet.

# text
