seg-0d53db66a990 = Events are sent in an RFC { "5424" } envelope (facility local0, app <c1/>, message id <c2/>) over UDP (one datagram each; IPv4 or IPv6) or TCP, newline-terminated by default or, with <c3/>, framed <c4/> as in RFC { "6587" }. By default one event is sent per band change; <c5/> sends one per epoch. The vendor is written <c6/> (ASCII) so no SIEM mis-decodes it.

