seg-1f099d4ef4b6 = In CEF the geometry uses dictionary custom fields only (no invented keys); the label rides in <c1/> rather than <c2/> because the Logstash CEF codec does not map the <c3/> fields. The { "1.3" } geometry events, the label cases included, are part of the VALIDATED CEF row: both oracle parsers read them back as written (<c4/>, amendments { "4" } and { "5" }, each registered before either parser was run on its cases). The label, VDOP and satellite-count fields are appended after every earlier field and series, and only for inputs that carry the label, so an input without one renders exactly as before.

# text
